{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-web-search-litellm#feature-1","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-web-search-litellm","commit":"b3b44000413c32409bf02bd72ea953503705390f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-litellm 的功能「代理联网搜索」：将查询通过 Responses API 发给 LiteLLM，并启用服务端 web_search。回答和打开页面的 URL 作为搜索结果返回给 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider.js:256-280","lib/provider.js:316-330"]}
{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-web-search-litellm#feature-2","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-web-search-litellm","commit":"b3b44000413c32409bf02bd72ea953503705390f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-litellm 的功能「模型回退发现」：先使用当前或缓存的模型；若模型没有执行搜索或超时，则并行尝试候选模型，并采用首个实际触发 web_search 的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider.js:199-230","lib/provider.js:235-260"]}
